1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
PECODROP ENTERPRISE RECYCLING KIOSK
Manufactured by ISP Environmental Solutions Pvt. Ltd.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Two landscape displays guide employees and show the live corporate leaderboard.
Scan the start QR or use the approved employee authentication method.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Wait until the session is ready and the required compartment shows AVAILABLE.
Insert only one approved item when instructed.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:28,000
PLASTIC: Use the magenta CIRCLE aperture for empty PET bottles.
Release the bottle and wait for acceptance before inserting another item.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,000
CANS / METAL: Use the emerald TRIANGLE aperture for empty beverage cans.
Never insert aerosols, batteries, liquids, or sharp metal.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
OFFICE PAPER: Use the cyan SQUARE aperture. Paper is measured by weight.
Recycle only documents permitted by your organization's privacy policy.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
If an item is rejected, wait for all movement to stop and follow the screen.
Never reach inside or force an intake gate. Thank you for recycling!
